{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17290","headline":"九华观宴饯崔十七叔判官赴义武幕兼呈书记萧校书 · 权德舆","name":"九华观宴饯崔十七叔判官赴义武幕兼呈书记萧校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎光三伏昼，洞府宜幽步。\n宿雨润芝田，鲜风摇桂树。\n阴阴台殿敞，靡靡轩车驻。\n晚酌临水清，晨装出关路。\n偏荣本郡辟，倍感元臣遇。\n记室有门人，因君达书素。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}